# PERMANENT-ANCHOR 锚点文件: 强制 LF, 禁止 git 行尾转换
# 原因: 锚点完整性基于 SHA-256 字节级校验, CRLF/LF 抖动会致 verify 误报 FAIL
# 这些文件是治理栈底座, 任何变更必须走 --update "原因" 流程
governance/anchors/ANCHORS.md      text eol=lf
governance/anchors/BOUNDARY.md     text eol=lf
governance/anchors/REDLINES.md     text eol=lf
governance/anchors/anchor_manifest.json text eol=lf
governance/anchors/update_log.jsonl text eol=lf
governance/anchors/recovery_log.jsonl text eol=lf
governance/anchors/blocked_attempts.jsonl text eol=lf
governance/anchors/checkpoint_log.jsonl text eol=lf
